    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a deliberate break? i feel like i've taken every break there is. i can't even afford a vacation, let alone a \"break\" from the reality of my bank account. it just feels like the more I run, the more I'm just digging a deeper hole. like there isn't even a version of the future where this stops. it's just more of the same, forever.",
